		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">5</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">This is correct answer.

There are 3 properties of a valley as described below.
1. All the steps must be below sea level
2. Starting step is a "down" step from sea level
3. Ending step is an "up" step to sea level</attribute>
