a. Taking input as an integer (step 1)
b. Creating new variables (steps 1, 2, 3, 5.1 and 9.1)
c. Displaying output (steps 5.4 and 9.4)
d. Repeat a set of steps for a given number of times (steps 4, 5.2, 5.3, 8, 9.2 and 9.3)
e. Modifying a variable (steps 5.5, 5.6, 6, 7, 9.5 and 9.6)

We have discussed all of the above in previous assignments multiple times.</attribute>
