			<attribute key="id" type="int">26</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Below, we have 3 different methods to note down a trek. Which method is used in the current problem?

Method 1: +1 for up, -1 for down.
E.g. +1+1-1+1-1-1-1+1

Method 2: U for up, D for down
E.g. UUDUDDDU

Method 3: Altitude of each step
E.g. 121210-10</attribute>
