		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">51</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Let us try to summarize our observations.
1. The pattern has 2*n-1 lines
2. Any pattern will start with (n-1) spaces followed by 1 star
3. Each next line will have 1 less space and 2 more stars
4. This way we will have n lines
5. After that, each next line will have 1 more space and 2 less stars
6. This way we will have (n-1) lines</attribute>
			<section name="graphics">
				<attribute key="x" type="double">4597.001343001913</attribute>
				<attribute key="y" type="double">3070.8268765626426</attribute>
